Subspecies
There are two recognised subspecies {{As of|2024|04|lc=y}}, namely:
 Agathis robusta subsp. nesophila Whitmore which is restricted to eastern New Guinea and New Britain{{R|POWO2}}{{R|WHITMORE|p=64}}
 Agathis robusta ssp. robusta, the autonymous subspecies, which is native to New Guinea and Queensland.{{R|POWO}}
